{"availability":"available","full":"mearashadowfax/LinkFrame","name":"LinkFrame","description":"Create professional LinkedIn profile banners with circular frames and custom text - real-time editor with drag-and-drop functionality","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2024-10-10T19:54:34Z","updated":"2026-10-05T09:06:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://link-frame.vercel.app","topics":["astro","image-editor","linkedin","tailwindcss","typescript","ui-tool","web-app"],"demo":"https://link-frame.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:37:49.210Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T15:37:49.210Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T15:37:49.210Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T15:37:49.210Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A free web tool that turns your profile photo into a LinkedIn-ready picture with a colored circular frame and curved text, like #OPENTOWORK or #HIRING, in your own colors and wording. Everything runs in your browser, so your photo never leaves your machine, and you get an 800×800 PNG ready to upload to LinkedIn."],"features":["Private. The image is rendered on an HTML canvas in the browser. No upload, no server, no account.","Your own text. Up to 32 characters curved along the frame, with adjustable color, font size, letter spacing, and placement.","Full control of the frame. Pick the color, thickness, and where the arc starts and ends — a full ring or a partial accent with soft fading edges.","Position the photo precisely. Drag it inside the preview, rotate it from −180° to 180°, and scale it from 0.1× to 1.9×, with a background color behind it.","Live preview. Every change re-renders instantly. Reset to the defaults with one click."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mearashadowfax/LinkFrame/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e22e541162ff421db2c7df1a570800ecf592f3618bbc93eaea211e757c96646a","extractedAt":"2026